7:    collision is a matching row-major boolean grid (true = blocked). Object
8:    records are visual/collision props; NPCs use tile coordinates and an
9:    optional trainer id from data.js. A warp is triggered on its {x,y} tile
10:    and places the player at {toX,toY} in `to`. Door records additionally
11:    describe building entrances. The world renderer can draw the tile IDs as
12:    pixel-art terrain; all coordinates are in 32px tiles.
